@* (web): _ViewImports applies these lines to EVERY page in the Pages folder,
   so each page doesn't need its own `using` lines.
   "addTagHelper" switches on Tag Helpers: the asp-page, asp-for, asp-items... attributes you'll see in the HTML. *@
@using TalentCRM
@using TalentCRM.Models
@using TalentCRM.Services
@using TalentCRM.Helpers
@namespace TalentCRM.Pages
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
